{"3920990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blood Welkin", "steam_appid": 3920990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920990/extras/416d563b2f55cdc691cc425d1a1cafa8.poster.avif?t=1782309612\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920990/extras/416d563b2f55cdc691cc425d1a1cafa8.webm?t=1782309612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920990/extras/416d563b2f55cdc691cc425d1a1cafa8.mp4?t=1782309612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood Welkin</strong> is a first person roguelite where building your personalized kit is key. Use multiple weapons and dozens of upgrades to make yourself unstoppable against the endless horde of cultists and a murder of heinous Ascended Abominations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Features</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Arsenal:</strong> 3 Different weapon types with their own banes and boons</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play-style Customization:</strong> A wide array of unique items to totally personalize and customize any type of build. From increasing your gun's fire rate, to dealing devastating melee blows, to summoning holy beams of light from the heavens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Bosses:</strong> Difficult Ascended Abominations with distinct abilities, requiring different strategies to take them down</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast Paced Classic FPS Gun Play:</strong> Brutal gore and relentlessly fast game-play that rewards quick reflexes, precision aiming, and immediate &amp; accurate decision making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Bleak World:</strong> Uncover a rich, disturbing backstory detailing an alt-history Great War</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>YOU. ARE. NOT. CRAZY.</u></strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920990/extras/416d563b2f55cdc691cc425d1a1cafa8.poster.avif?t=1782309612\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920990/extras/416d563b2f55cdc691cc425d1a1cafa8.webm?t=1782309612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920990/extras/416d563b2f55cdc691cc425d1a1cafa8.mp4?t=1782309612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood Welkin</strong> is a first person roguelite where building your personalized kit is key. Use multiple weapons and dozens of upgrades to make yourself unstoppable against the endless horde of cultists and a murder of heinous Ascended Abominations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Features</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Arsenal:</strong> 3 Different weapon types with their own banes and boons</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play-style Customization:</strong> A wide array of unique items to totally personalize and customize any type of build. From increasing your gun's fire rate, to dealing devastating melee blows, to summoning holy beams of light from the heavens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Bosses:</strong> Difficult Ascended Abominations with distinct abilities, requiring different strategies to take them down</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>